464273.overview:
Widebody Muscle cars meet JDM legends & Euro classics. Authentic drift physics, arcade-fast fun. Tune everything: colors, wheels, liveries, plates. Career, weekly and special events. IAP optional.

Drift Legends 2 is a free-to-play drift racing game built for 60 FPS on Nintendo Switch™. Throw modern muscle, timeless JDM, and European icons sideways across tough runs and street courses with responsive, arcade-friendly handling that still rewards real drifting technique.

Features:
Authentic drift physics with assists for newcomers;
40+ cars: widebody muscle, JDM legends, and European classics;
Career, weekly challenges and time attack;
Car tuning & customization: stance, plates, wheels and livery;
Clean visuals, MPH units, Pro Controller support;
The core drift experience is free to download and play. The game offers optional in-game purchases for cosmetic items and convenience packs. No account required to start. Offline play supported.
